  "9029": {
    "en": [
      "I sit at your door, Lord, all day long — tears stream from my eyes.",
      "What does the world hold? The heart is not filled —",
      "carrying my soul's longing in my soul, I have wandered here from door to door.",
      "Leaving everything I have come here; do not turn away from this poor wretch —",
      "whatever you do, I shall stay lying here."
