  "9030": {
    "en": [
      "The Beloved has called — who will stay at home?",
      "So I have come to call you — come, make haste.",
      "You whose hearts are burning, you will wipe away your streaming tears;",
      "after so many days the ache of separation will end.",
      "Today in this sky what a nectar-lute is playing,",
      "the world today, thrilling, is decked in what sweet splendor!",
      "Today in this sweet world a sweet union will come —",
      "his face of love has awakened within the heart."
