  "9031": {
    "en": [
      "The boat sails on the wind of grace — whoever would go, come to the house of peace.",
      "Darkness has closed around this worldly life — why sit here with downcast face?",
      "The soul's longing is not fulfilled here — where here is love, where is joy?",
      "Let this worldly clamor, this poison of sin, this fire of sorrow and grief pass far away.",
      "Looking ahead, singing in rapture, come — let us go, following his call.",
      "I will not carry worldly cares along — let petty joys and sorrows lie behind.",
      "The world's night will close in deep darkness — whose face will you look to then?",
      "Having given up your cherished wealth and kin, for what hope will you keep your life?"
    ],
