  "9032": {
    "en": [
      "Standing at the Father's door, all of you, forget your wounded pride.",
      "Come, brothers, come — today, soul to soul, keep no distance between you.",
      "Come with the world's dust washed away, come with a smile upon your face.",
      "On the platter of your heart, brothers, bring heaps upon heaps of the flowers of love.",
      "Wrapped in yourselves with arid hearts, you stayed forgetful of him —",
      "ah, you never raised your eyes to look on the face of the destitute!",
      "You suffered pain from harsh blows, and you pained the souls of others —",
      "lost in quarrels over trifling words, your day has come to its end.",
      "Having come before him, will you still not forget yourselves today?",
      "To call him into the heart, will the heart not open?",
      "All together we shall share out the nectar of his love —",
      "everyone is heir to the Father's boundless wealth of treasures."
    ],
