  "9033": {
    "en": [
      "I shall keep you with tender care, keep you near —",
      "with the honeyed fragrance of love's blossoms, Lord, I shall beguile you.",
      "In your love, friend, I shall be adorned in beauty —",
      "stealer of hearts, I shall stay watching your road.",
      "You will come of yourself — how could you stay away any longer —",
      "and, your sweet smile blossoming, you will remain in the sky of my heart."
    ],
