    "en": [
      "Today the soul's friend has come — behold, all the world.",
      "Night has spread his seat across the floor of heaven,",
      "planets and stars have stood round the assembly.",
      "Silently forest and mountain stayed gazing at the sky,",
      "and the earth stilled the clamor of day."
