  "9036": {
    "en": [
      "His stream of joy flows on through the world;",
      "come, all men and women, bringing your own hearts.",
      "In that joy the gardens blossom every moment;",
      "in that joy the river runs, telling the tidings of joy.",
      "In that holy cascade's stream the universe is bathing;",
      "hold that stream of nectar, filling heart and soul.",
      "You have come to the shore — will you go back empty,",
      "will you drown at last in your own tears, still thirsting?",
      "Forever this sky is full of fresh blue;",
      "forever this earth stays blossoming in its youth.",
      "Drinking that draught of joy, eternal love wakes in the soul,",
      "and the world's fever does not burn, though we dwell within the world."
    ],
