  "9037": {
    "en": [
      "Hari, I call to you — alone in the world",
      "I run through a dark forest.",
      "In the deep gloom, through the water of my eyes,",
      "I search and cannot find the path.",
      "Always the thought comes, 'What shall I do? What shall I do?'",
      "When will the night of death arrive —",
      "so I die of fear and call, Hari! Hari!",
      "Besides Hari there is no one.",
      "The tears of these eyes will not be in vain;",
      "all say you cherish your devotees —",
      "that hope I have made the provision of my heart;",
      "only for that am I still alive.",
      "In the darkness your starry eyes keep watch;",
      "your devotee never loses the way —",
      "my soul longs for you, you are the pole star —",
      "to whom else should I look?"
    ],
    "align": [
      [["হরি", "Hari"], ["তোমায়", "to you"], ["ডাকি", "call"], ["সংসারে", "in the world"], ["একাকী", "alone"]],
