  "9038": {
    "en": [
      "Because six together show me the way, at every step I lose the way.",
      "With many wiles of words many sages speak, so I sway in doubt.",
      "To come to you — that was my desire,",
      "to hear your word and end my error,",
      "but at my ear everyone is quarreling —",
      "a hundred people, a hundred sayings.",
      "When with an anguished soul I beg for you,",
      "they all stand close, screening you from me;",
      "so I am left with the dust of the earth —",
      "I never gain your feet's dust.",
      "My hundred parts run in a hundred directions,",
      "picking quarrels among themselves —",
      "which shall I restrain? What a plight this is —",
      "one alone, and yet so many.",
      "Make me one, binding me in your love;",
      "show me one path, unbroken —",
      "caught in the maze, how I die weeping —",
      "lift me up and take me to your feet."
    ],
