  "9042": {
    "en": [
      "Save, oh save, Hari, this poor soul.",
      "Call to your path, Merciful One, this man without worship or discipline.",
      "On the shoreless sea I see no rescue; this soul is worn out by sin and burning —",
      "in the midst of death give me refuge; keep this weak and failing one.",
      "Night has closed round, the light has gone out; my day has ended in futile work —",
      "no path, Lord, no provision for the road — I call you with all my life.",
      "Losing all direction, I forever wander dying; I drift far, far away from you;",
      "I lose the path down to the abyss — these eyes are blind in the dense cloud of delusion."
    ],
