  "9044": {
    "en": [
      "Forgive me too.",
      "Give me too, Lord, a drop of nectar.",
      "Having left home and come to the road, I sit in faded clothes;",
      "in my heart too, make your seat.",
      "I know, I am your soiled child —",
      "to me too you must give a place at your feet.",
      "By my own doing I have sunk in sin; I weep in remorse —",
      "hear this heart's anguish of mine too."
