  "9045": {
    "en": [
      "Do not turn back, do not turn back today — you have come to the door.",
      "Where do you go with an empty soul into the empty world?",
      "Go and see him today; calling, bring him into your heart —",
      "take nectar, filling your inmost core.",
      "Keeping your dry soul dry, to whom do you look?",
      "Hearing a few empty words, where do you go away?",
      "Tell him your words and go carrying his words —",
      "go to him, leaving yourself in his keeping."
    ],
