      "myriad worlds lie immersed in that great ocean.",
      "He is absorbed within his own matchless glory —",
      "who can seek him out? Veda and Vedanta fail.",
      "Supreme Brahman, all-complete, exceedingly great —",
      "he is the primal cause, he is beyond description."
