  "9048": {
    "en": [
      "I do not know you, yet my mind runs to you.",
      "Not knowing you, the universe still finds its rest in you.",
      "Your boundless beauty — who has ever felt it?",
      "That sweetness is ever new —",
      "not knowing, I have surrendered my soul to you.",
      "You are the light of lights; I am blind in darkness.",
      "You are free and exalted; I am sunk in the deep.",
      "You are endless, I am small and poor — what a wondrous union, you and I."
    ],
