      "Now I understand, friend — this play is only play —",
      "with human life it is only neglect.",
      "Without you the wailing will never end —",
      "with what do you keep me beguiled, with what do you while away the hours?",
      "In vain the sun and moon smile, in vain come day and night —",
      "suddenly the soul weeps, seeing emptiness on every side.",
