  "9050": {
    "en": [
      "I do not wish to live in comfort — see how many poor souls are weeping.",
      "So many cries of grief rise to the sky; life's bonds snap in an instant;",
      "so many, laid in dust, seek in shame to hide their tarnished lives.",
      "My hearing is deafened by grief and wailing; I cannot hear your word;",
      "to release the heart's pain, whom do I call, whom shall I call?",
      "Pour the nectar of hope into our souls; bless your afflicted children —",
      "calling those who lost the way toward home, you must keep them at your feet.",
      "Give love to console the grieving, to end the torment of the pained;",
      "send forth your rays into tear-filled eyes."
